{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3265caf78521840cf4592e9293a4ad8fbcc7d99fd23afa3a22756d4c42d8db77",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fd203647ba9564faf4f6d84a2861dd5a372c1e74e1a1b2f7e8116c15e275d85",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，方便聊聊吗？\n我正在整理今天买的巧克力，结果……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3ab93b72cbfbeba3d2ba8255828a6d98284472d593246a13fabf3b32d7cc144",
      "text": "本打算买来给事务所当慰劳品的那份，\n不小心顺手带回家了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:268e03b04cb3227b41421c7e86f0125e55c2126288cc7d16552b331261ddff7b",
      "text": "逛了太多家店，\n和给自己买的巧克力混在一起了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf8512d1d8e0a679f2eeb3da8c31cf8d683a6dc4f59e6079f6cedb708bf2c467",
      "text": "明天工作前我会带去事务所的。\n制作人不嫌弃的话也吃点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abe6c86d89e8a3f2abbf11ad11f1081d9039387501ff7aa5d9a9eafc57c005c4",
      "text": "自己的巧克力已经吃了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef626ec5edc0ee08b30d7d8ad1b0832c4512327f8fdd4f1656d46054d30fca00",
      "text": "买东西的过程玩得开心吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b58ff264857bcfc5b9bb979d2229e7a0eff0ec3b341088f178b49b907e802f6e",
      "text": "刚才尝了几个。\n和大家交换的巧克力也很好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47dc5b75e961c756e09d4ce210681c12d3b3e6336a4d77a9cf9d36e4204d624a",
      "text": "嗯。\n多亏了和大家一起逛，买到了不错的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9f049b125b2705b41ef8f2721c6d74213289f4bfa5836c421693af9e6a92f45",
      "text": "能亲眼看到顾客们享受活动的模样，\n我觉得也很有意义。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da0714a7de86e3303ae705f20842da8b802e913783d0c216fc5642c5dc8d21b",
      "text": "像传闻中一样，顾客的年龄层很广，让我挺吃惊的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea19e98e5d7063e12ca9a2d164bf7faebef621badcc93a52ee6670e348fbca94",
      "text": "……这就代表，百货商场想传达的心意\n好好地传递出去了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b7329195c1da4d99d661d543d47cbf0370b7a9149498369223e320abd3cc8ab",
      "text": "今后我也想成为一个能将别人寄托的心意\n完好送达的偶像。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1764254cc15cc885c0f23157e357ae7203bff876386c30b45b50efd390b0ae24",
      "text": "我会全力支援你的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:038tak_403_2_4_038_03_09_a:2_4_038_03_09_a:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91bed3f7d584cf5727b1d9fd63324b7cdfc07003f037c94b170802a3bfd4c800",
      "text": "谢了，制作人。\n那么，下一项工作见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
